1 NOTE OR "DARIUS I"; KNOWN AS "THE GREAT"; GREAT KING OF PERSIA 522-486 BC; PER-'O AS
2 CONT SETETU-RE' ANTARYUASH 522-486 BC; b. 550/45 BC-d. 11/486 BC; HAD 14 OTHER
