2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''
2 CONT =Meleager=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Meleager of Macedon (Greek: Μελέαγρος) was the brother of Ptolemy Ceraunus and son of Ptolemy I Soter and Eurydice. Meleager ruled in 279 BC for two months until he was compelled by his Macedonian troops to resign his crown.
2 CONT
