2 CONC 006101322857 '''Sirras''']) were the leaders of the Illyrians who supported the Lyncestians against an expedition by the Macedonians in 423 BC.[1] The Illyrian-Lyncestian troops defeated the Macedonian-Spartan alliance.
2 CONT
2 CONT He probably was the grandfather of [https://www.geni.com/people/Grabos-II-Illyrian-King-of-Taulantia-c-358-356-BC/6000000205380959848 '''Grabos II'''].
