2 CONT
2 CONT [S723] Herodotus of Halicarnassus, The History of Herodotus (London and New York: MacMillan and Co., 1890). Hereinafter cited as Herodotus' History.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S204] Roderick W. Stuart, RfC, 413-84.
2 CONT
