1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stratonice_of_Cappadocia
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''
2 CONT =Stratonice of Cappadocia=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Stratonice (Greek: Στρατονίκη; fl. 3rd century BC) was a Syrian Greek Princess of the Seleucid Empire. Stratonice was of Greek Macedonian and Persian descent. She was one of the daughters born to the Seleucid Monarchs Antiochus II
2 CONC  Theos and Laodice I. Among her brothers was the Seleucid King Seleucus II Callinicus and prince Antiochus Hierax.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between 255 BC-250 BC, Antiochus II Theos recognized the Seleucid client state of Cappadocia to become an independent kingdom. In 255 BC, Ariarathes III of Cappadocia who co-ruled with his father, proclaimed himself as the first k
2 CONC ing of Cappadocia. Later that year, Antiochus II Theos arranged for Stratonice to marry Ariarathes III.
2 CONT
2 CONT Through her marriage to Ariarathes III, Stratonice became the first Queen of Cappadocia. Stratonice and Ariarathes III, had a son called Ariarathes IV of Cappadocia who later succeeded his father as King. Ariarathes IV later marri
2 CONC ed his maternal second cousin Antiochis.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stratonice_of_Cappadocia
