2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 15 MAR 44 BC in stabbed in Roman Senate
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Caius Julius III of Rome Caesar 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Aurelia (Cornelia) of Rome
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Lucia Calpurnia Piso
