2 CONT In fiction
2 CONT
2 CONT Cleopatra is mentioned in the novels by Robert Graves, I, Claudius and Claudius the God.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cleopatra is a significant character in Wallace Breem's historical novel The Legate's Daughter (1974), Phoenix/Orion Books Ltd. ISBN 0 75381 895 7
2 CONT
2 CONT Cleopatra's Daughter by Michelle Moran tells the story of Cleopatra's early life; from the demise of her parents until her marriage to Juba II of Numidia.
