2 CONC ncestry. His father was King Ariobarzanes II of Cappadocia and his mother was Queen Athenais. He became king after his brother Ariobarzanes III Philoromaios was killed. His rule did not last long as Mark Antony of Rome removed and
2 CONC  executed him, replacing him with Sisines, who became Archelaus of Cappadocia.
