2 CONT
2 CONT '''King Orodes III of Parthia''' was raised to the throne of the Parthian Empire around AD 4 by the magnates after the death of Phraates V of Parthia (reigned ca. 2 BC – AD 4). He was killed after a short reign "on account of his 
2 CONC extreme cruelty" (Josephus). After his death, Phraates V's brother Vonones I (reigned ca. 8–12) tried to assume the throne, but a civil war with Artabanus II (reigned ca. 10–38) followed.http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orodes_III_of_
2 CONC Parthia
