2 CONC ce of Thrace was the mother of Demetrius I Poliorcetes, King of Phrygia and Macedonia; the son of Antigonus by his wife, Stratonice, the daughter of Corrhaeus.3  Family Antigonus I Monophthalamos, King of Phrygia b. 0382 B.C., d. 
