1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Pythodorida of Pontus===
2 CONT Titles:
2 CONT *Queen of Pontus
2 CONT *Queen consort of the Bosporan Kingdom
2 CONT *Queen consort of Cilicia
2 CONT *Queen consort of Cappadocia
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses:
2 CONT *King Polemon I of Pontus
2 CONT *King Archelaus of Cappadocia
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue:
2 CONT *Artaxias III of Armenia
2 CONT *Polemon II of Pontus
2 CONT *Antonia Tryphaena, Queen of Thrace
2 CONT
2 CONT Father:
2 CONT *Pythodoros of Tralles
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother:
2 CONT *Antonia
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:
2 CONT *30 BC or 29 BC Smyrna
2 CONT
