2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Julia Gerunda verch TIBERIUS DRUSUS NERO - Abt 10 A.D. in Lugundum, Gaul - now Lyons,
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhone-Alpes, France
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Tiberius Claudius III TIBERIUS DRUSUS NERO - Abt 12 A.D. in Lugundum, Gaul - now Lyons,
2 CONT
