2 CONT ===The Lineage of Sara, called Doris of Jerusalem, the Wife of King Herod===
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesus Bar-Panthera married Bianca, and was executed in 63 BCE. They became the parents of;  à 
2 CONT Sarah 37 (aka Doris of Jerusalem) , who married King Herod the Great an Idumean à at this time the Royal
2 CONT
2 CONT Davidian lineage became Extinct because Doris of Jerusalem married outside of her family house and tribe; the House of David out of the Tribe of Judah. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Yet, this marriage was critical to King Herod in order to establish that he had married into the revered House of David.  It appeared that Herod had a strategy in the women that he married, and it was not concerned with the laws o
2 CONC f Torah. 
2 CONT
2 CONT As genealogist David Hughes explained: 
2 CONT
2 CONT David Hughes – “Herod had a difference of opinion about the laws of succession.
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife was a Davidide and his 2nd wife was a Maccabee, so he appears that he attempted to graft his pedigree into the family-tree of Israel's ancient kings & queens; which undoubtedly was this reason that Herod had his cou
