1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Saulos was mentioned by the contemporary Jewish historian [http://www.geni.com/people/Josephus-Titus-Flavius-%D7%99%D7%95%D7%A1%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%95%D7%A1-%D7%A4%D7%9C%D7%91%D7%99%D7%95%D7%A1/6000000010509648150 Josep
2 CONC hus] (Josephus, ''The Jewish War'' 2.418, 556–58, and ''The Antiquities'', 20.214 cf excepts below). Saulos reported the Roman reverses in Jerusalem to the [http://www.geni.com/people/Nero-Roman-Emperor/6000000000424698537 Emperor
2 CONC  Nero] in Corinth, which resulted in the dispatch of [http://www.geni.com/people/Vespasian-Roman-Emperor/6000000000701024840 Vespasian] from Britain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biblical scholar Robert Eisenman has suggested that Saulos might have been the same person as [http://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Paul-the-Apostle/6000000019951567378 Saint Paul the Apostle]. In this reconstruction, Paul's unnamed n
2 CONC ephew who warns him of a plot to kill him in the barracks (Acts 23:16) was [http://www.geni.com/people/Julius-Archelaus/6000000019965869503 Julius Archelaus], son of Paul's supposed sister [http://www.geni.com/people/Cypros/600000
2 CONC 0019966002384 Cypros] and her husband Temple Treasurer [http://www.geni.com/people/Alexas-Selcias/6000000016773990673 Alexas Helcias] (''James the Brother of Jesus''; ''The New Testament Code''; [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rober
2 CONC t_Eisenman#Paul_as_an_Herodian Wikipedia]) A further source used to sustain this potential relationship is Paul's words in Romans 16.11 "Greet Herodion, my kinsman." [Sharon July 2013]
2 CONT
2 CONT An interesting aside is that this Saulos & his siblings are the grandchildren of the arch enemies Mariamne Hasmonean (Herod's wife)  & Salome (Herod's sister). The result of Mariamne's daughter marrying Salome's son. [Sharon Oct 2
2 CONC 014]
2 CONT
