2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Marcus Aemilius Lepidus (c. 30 BC-33) was a Roman senator, politician and general, praised by the historian Tacitus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents [hide]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Origin and early career
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Activities during the reign of Tiberius
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 Descendants
