2 CONT # Livia Drusilla 38 BC – AD 14
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Offspring===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julia_the_Elder '''Julia the Elder'''];
2 CONT # [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaius_Caesar '''Gaius Caesar (adoptive)'''];
