2 CONC hn-Gaddi-%D7%99%D7%95%D7%97%D7%A0%D7%9F-%D7%94%D7%92%D7%93%D7%99-Maccabeus/6000000012128407630  John]), parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[http://www.geni.com/people/Matthias-Curtis/6000000016249905189 Matthias Curtis]''' (b. 135 BCE), father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Joseph/6000000012129738738 Joseph] (b. 67 BCE), father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Matityahu-Josephus-father/6000000010521300639 Matthias] (b. 6 CE), father of:
2 CONT
