1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nerva (/ˈnɜːrvə/; Latin: Marcus Cocceius Nerva Caesar Augustus;[1] 8 November 30 – 27 January 98 AD) was Roman emperor from 96 to 98. Nerva became emperor at the age of 65, after a lifetime of imperial service unde
