1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''
2 CONT =Josephus=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Josephus (Greek: Ἰώσηπος; flourished 1st century BC and 1st century, born about 30 BC) was an ethnic Jew living in Jerusalem.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josephus was the son born to Matthias Curtus and his unnamed Jewish wife. He came from a wealthy family and through his father he descended from the priestly order of the Jehoiarib, which was the first of the twenty four-orders of
2 CONC  Priests in the Temple in Jerusalem. His paternal grandparents were Matthias Ephlias and the daughter of the High Priest Jonathon. Jonathon may have been Alexander Jannaeus, the High Priest and Hasmonean ruler who governed Judea f
2 CONC rom 103-76 BC.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a contemporary to the King Herod the Great and the Herodian Dynasty governing Judea and the surrounding territories. Josephus followed his paternal ancestors and served as a Priest in the Temple in Jerusalem.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josephus married an unnamed Jewish noblewoman. The wife of Josephus was a distant paternal relative of his, as she was a descendant of his paternal great-grandfather Simon Psellus. His wife bore him a son, Matthias. Through his so
2 CONC n, he would be the paternal grandfather of the Roman Jewish Historian of the 1st century, Flavius Josephus.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josephus_(grandfather_of_Josephus)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Ford Mommaerts suggests the following ancestry for Jewish historian Flavius Josephus:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Simon-Psellos/6000000016249882344 Simon Psellos], father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Matthias-Ephlias/6000000016249886206 Matthias Ephlias], and wife [http://www.geni.com/people/daughter-of-John-Gaddi-Maccabeus/6000000012128309179 (anonyma)] (daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Jo
2 CONC hn-Gaddi-%D7%99%D7%95%D7%97%D7%A0%D7%9F-%D7%94%D7%92%D7%93%D7%99-Maccabeus/6000000012128407630  John]), parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Matthias-Curtis/6000000016249905189 Matthias Curtis] (b. 135 BCE), father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[http://www.geni.com/people/Joseph/6000000012129738738 Joseph]''' (b. 67 BCE), father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Matityahu-Josephus-father/6000000010521300639 Matthias] (b. 6 CE), father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Josephus-Titus-Flavius-%D7%99%D7%95%D7%A1%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%95%D7%A1-%D7%A4%D7%9C%D7%91%D7%99%D7%95%D7%A1/6000000010509648150 Flavius Josephus] (b. 37 CE).
2 CONT
2 CONT == Source ==
