1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Quintus Anicius Faustus Paulinus''' ca 180 - aft. 230/ca 232 was the Legate of Moesia Inferior between 229 and 230 or ca 230 to 232. He was the son of Quintus Anicius Faustus, Legate of Numidia and Consul in 198
2 CONC , and wife Sergia Paulla. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married a daughter of Sextus Cocceius Vibianus, a Senator in 204, and was the father of: 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Quintus Anicius Faustus born ca 210, married before 240 Asinia Juliana Nicomacha born ca 215, daughter of Gaius Asinius Nicomachus Julianus, Proconsul of Asia circa 250, and they were the parents of:
2 CONT ## Sextus Anicius Faustus Paulinus or Marcus Junius Caesonius Nicomachus Anicius Faustus Paulinus, Consul of Rome in 298
2 CONT ## Sextus Cocceius Anicius Faustus, Proconsul of Africa between 260 and 268 http://www.museumstuff.com/learn/topics/Quintus_Anicius_Faustus_Paulinus
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
