2 CONT =Sextus Appuleius I=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of his birth and death are unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Octavia Major, the elder half-sister of Augustus, by whom he had at least one son, also named Sextus Appuleius (II). It is postulated that he had a second son, Marcus Appuleius, the consul of 20 BC.
2 CONT
