1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''
2 CONT =Lucius Caesennius Antoninus=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucius Caesennius Antoninus (c. 95 - aft. 128) was a Roman politician.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Lucius Junius Caesennius Paetus, born c. 65, and wife Arria Antonina, born c. 70, a maternal aunt of Antoninus Pius, and paternal grandson of Lucius Junius Caesennius Paetus and wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Consul Suffectus between February and March 128.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married and had a daughter Arria Caesennia Paulina (c. 120 - aft. 161), domina figlia in 138 or 161, who married the famous General and Statesman Marcus Nonius Macrinus.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Caesennius_Antoninus
