1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nicholas was the uncle of the great [http://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Nik%C3%B2laos-de-Bari-Bishop-de-Myra/6000000007097847692 St. Nicholas], and it was he who guided him to the spiritual life and ordained him a pr
2 CONC iest.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bishop Nicholas of Patara rejoiced at the spiritual success and deep piety of his nephew. He ordained him a reader, and then elevated Nicholas to the priesthood, making him his assistant and entrusting him to instruct the flock.
