2 CONT
2 CONT Translation (with Wikipedia from Hungarian to English)
2 CONT
2 CONT With ''főellenségével, capital enemy'' The People's Party  Publius Cornelius Scipio Aemilianus Africanus was personal hostility. Shortly after death of Tiberius in 133 BC he died. '''Appius, a younger son''' also had his opponent 
