2 CONC er of Lucius Cornelius Sulla and served as praetor in 88 BC. He was exiled in that year by Gaius Marius while Sulla was away in the east. He returned to Rome after Lucius Cornelius Cinna died in 84 BC, and served as consul in 79 B
2 CONC C and as governor of Roman Macedonia from 78 BC to 76 BC.
2 CONT
