2 CONT 1for his full name, see ILS , 724, 726; such variations as Flavius Constans ( ILS , 708, 728, 730; BCH , 70[1946], 260B), Constans ( ILS , 723, 728, 729), and Flavius Iunius Constans ( ILS , 725) appear on inscriptions. Constans' 
2 CONC life is discussed by O. Seeck, RE 4, s.v. "Constans (3)," col. 948ff.. 
