1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rufius Viventius Gallus From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Rufius Viventius Gallus (mid 5th-century) was a Roman politician, who was urban prefect in the mid 5th-century.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Flavius Avitus Marinianus and wife Anastasia.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married his cousin Aviena
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
