1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT
1 CONT Other works
1 CONT
1 CONT     * The 2000 album Born from the string quartet bond, includes a song titled "Alexander the Great".
1 CONT     * The British heavy metal band Iron Maiden had a song entitled "Alexander the Great" on their album Somewhere in Time (1986). The song describes Alexander's life, but contains one inaccuracy: In the song it is stated that Alex
1 CONC ander's army would not follow him into India.
1 CONT     * Brazilian musician Caetano Veloso's 1998 album Livro includes an epic song about Alexander called "Alexandre".
1 CONT     * Alexander is a character in the computer games Empire Earth and Rise of Nations: Thrones and Patriots. He is a civilization leader in the Civilization IV computer game, where Alexander is the lone leader of the Greek civiliz
1 CONC ation and has the leader traits "Aggressive" and "Philosophical". In the Rome Total War expansion pack, Alexander, Alexander the Great's conquest's are chronicled in a campaign and six battles are modeled on Alexander's early batt
1 CONC les. Alexander the Great is also featured in the game called "Rise and Fall, Civilization at War" released by Midway games.
1 CONT     * In Alan Moore's Watchmen, one of the main characters, Ozymandias, goes into detail about how he followed in Alexander the Great's footsteps in order to achieve enlightenment.
