1 CONT Polybius, Histories, ii. 43-45, ix. 29, 34 
1 CONT Gabbert, Janice; Antigonus II Gonatas: A Political Biography (1997) 
1 CONT Thirlwall, Connop; History of Greece, vol. viii. (1847) 
