1 CONT 2. married Mariamme (I.) - daughter of Hasmonean Alexandros
1 CONT
1 CONT Son Alexandros, executed 7 BC 
1 CONT Son Aristobulos, executed 7 BC 
1 CONT Daughter Salampsio 
1 CONT Daughter Cypros 
1 CONT 3. married Mariamme (II.) - daughter of High-Priest Simon
1 CONT
1 CONT Son Herod 
1 CONT 4. married Malthace
1 CONT
1 CONT Son Herodes Archelaos - Ethnarch 
1 CONT Son Herodes Antipas - Tetrarch 
1 CONT Daughter Olympias 
1 CONT 5. married Cleopatra of Jerusalem
1 CONT
1 CONT Son Herod Philip - Tetrarch 
1 CONT Son Herod 
1 CONT 6. married Pallas
1 CONT
1 CONT Son Phasael 
1 CONT 7. married Phaidra
1 CONT
1 CONT Daughter Roxane 
1 CONT 8. married Elpis
1 CONT
1 CONT Daughter Salome 
1 CONT 9. married a cousin name unknown
1 CONT
1 CONT 10. married a niece name unknown
1 CONT
1 CONT It is very probable that Herod had more children, especially with the last wives, and also that he had more daughters, as women at that time were not counted as important.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
