1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Marcus Vipsanius Agrippa 
1 CONT 63 BC – 12 BC 
1 CONT
1 CONT Marcus Vipsanius Agrippa 
1 CONT Place of birth Unknown 
1 CONT Place of death Campania 
1 CONT Allegiance Roman Empire 
1 CONT Years of service 45 BC – 12 BC 
1 CONT Rank General 
