1 CONC  of birth between March 64 and March 62. A calendar from Cyprus or Syria includes a month named after Agrippa beginning on November 1, which may reflect the month of his birth. See Reinhold, pp. 2–4; Roddaz, pp. 23–26. 
1 CONT ^ Reinhold, p. 9; Roddaz, p. 23. 
